# Apex 3 proposed switch layout, matching Bjorn-25 ranges; verify Apex AUX mapping.
# AUX1 high ARM. AUX2 low Acro (default), middle Angle, high Horizon.
# AUX3 high beeper. AUX4 high Altitude Hold.
# AUX5 high Flip Over After Crash. These lines assign switch ranges; they do
# not add modes to firmware. Altitude Hold requires Betaflight 2025.12+ built
# with ALTITUDE_HOLD.
# Verify altitude data and tune hover_throttle before relying on this mode.
aux 0 0 0 1700 2100 0 0
aux 1 1 1 1300 1700 0 0
aux 2 13 2 1700 2100 0 0
aux 3 35 4 1700 2100 0 0
aux 4 2 1 1700 2100 0 0
aux 5 3 3 1700 2100 0 0
save
